Text=I'm no wizard, but there are a few things I've learned these three hundred years. From what I know, the enchanter carved out this place from a plane of pure magic, but got stuck somehow. He's been linking crystals to allow people to come here, but not leave, for centuries. He's quite mad, but I suppose so am I.
