Text=Hmmmph! Of all the- Well, I mean- That is- Hmmph. Oh, very well - you're right, of course. Who knows? Perhaps it is that...minor...moral flaw that has kept my spirit anchored here. I'll make that bridge for you, and who knows? You seem bright enough. Perhaps you can find some way to deal with that enchanter.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
